                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/ski-touring-mont-blanc/ski-touring-mont-blanc"
                            paragraphScope="range"
                            text="Ski Touring Mont Blanc Around Mont Blanc the lifts stop where the best skiing begins. On skins, with a mountain guide, you reach glaciers and high valleys that most visitors only see from a cable car. We spend three nights in a chalet in the Chamonix valley and one in a mountain hut. You should ski confidently off piste in all kinds of snow and be fit enough to climb a thousand metres in a day; touring experience is useful and not required."
                            variationName="master">
