                            paragraphScope="range"
                            text="Ski Touring Mont Blanc Dress in layers that you can add and remove quickly: you will be hot on the climb and cold at the top within the same half hour. Touring skis, bindings, boots and skins Avalanche transceiver, shovel and probe Harness, ski crampons and helmet A rucksack of 30 to 35 litres Thin and thick gloves, goggles and sunglasses All of the technical equipment can be hired in the valley; tell us your sizes when you book."
